        </ezobject:attribute>
        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="2493" ezremote:identifier="body" name="Body" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/">
            <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">
              <embed size="original" view="embed" align="center" object_remote_id="ezdemo-img-blog-migration"/>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph>Exponential grew out of eZ Publish, the open source CMS first released in 1999. Many sites from that era still run today, and every one of them has a path to 6.0.15.</paragraph>
            <section>
              <section>
                <header>The path</header>
                <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">
                  <ol>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Take a copy of the database and the storage.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Install 6.0.15 next to the old site and point it at the copy.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Run the upgrade scripts release by release, then check the extensions your site uses.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Switch the designs to the modern versions, or keep yours and adopt the new toolbar.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                  </ol>
                </paragraph>
              </section>
            </section>
          </section>
